okra — AI agent orchestration toolkit

Topics:
  schedule  AI agent task scheduler via macOS launchd.
  counsel   Route a prompt to the opposite local coding agent.
  repo      Multi-registry source code cache manager CLI.
  skills    Manage AI agent skills installed in $SKILLS_DIR (defaults to ~/Developer/personal/dotfiles/skills).
  image     Generate images from text prompts with GPT Image 2.5 Flare or Sunburst.
  keys      Manage stored API keys for okra (the shared ~/.okra/keys.json secret store).

Run `okra how <topic>` for the full guide.
